 "about": "A dead end between the stacks: where somebody with no tag is run down and taken (ATownGameMode's 'take' deed, AGutGameMode::IsTaking). It is a place the town's builder makes (GUT_TOWN_LIST=$PWD/Tools/town_alley.json Tools/build_town_level.sh) but it is fought in, not walked: 'fight' gives it the cage's rules and stands the one who is to be taken at its far end. Places are in the map's own metres (x east, y north). Twenty metres long, so that whoever looks over the player's shoulder has room behind them: at fourteen the gate was 2.3 m behind the player and the camera was inside the two of them.",
